out/
# Exception: the specific artifacts embedded by base-test-utils via `sol!(..., ".../out/*.json")`
# are force-committed (see `git ls-files .../out`) so the crate is self-contained and usable as a
# git dependency, where gitignored build output would be absent and the compile-time include would
# fail. Regenerate them with `forge build`; they are deterministic for the pinned solc + soldeer deps.

